    "result": "The fix is complete and tested successfully! Here's what I did:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n**Problem:** The `frai gate init --ci` command was not creating the GitHub Actions workflow file (`.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`) when called through the `frai` CLI, because the `--ci` flag was being consumed by the parent `frai` command and not passed to the `frai-gate` subcommand.\n\n**Solution:** Modified `/packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts` to check if `--ci` is present in `process.argv` and pass it through to the `frai-gate` CLI when spawning the process.\n\n**Verification:**\n- \u2705 `frai gate init --ci` now creates both `FRAI-SPEC.md` and `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`\n- \u2705 The workflow file contains the proper GitHub Actions configuration\n- \u2705 The fix has been compiled and tested\n\nThe modified files are ready to commit. Would you like me to create a git commit with these changes?",
